  "body": "A considered transformation. A coveted coastal setting. An opportunity that will not be repeated.\r\n\r\nSome homes make an impression. Others make you want to move straight in. This beautifully renovated Devonport residence brings together timeless character, contemporary comfort and an enviable coastal lifestyle. With the renovation complete and our clients committed to selling, this is an opportunity to secure a quality home in one of Auckland's most cherished seaside communities.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 556sqm freehold site in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this thoughtfully transformed single level residence offers the space, privacy and relaxed living that make Devonport so desirable. The hard work has been done, the presentation is inviting and everything is ready for its next owner.\r\n\r\nAt 113sqm, the home offers three bedrooms, two bathrooms including a master ensuite, and welcoming living spaces designed for effortless everyday living. An open wood fireplace brings warmth and character, while front and rear entertaining decks create an inviting connection to the outdoors. A separate garden studio provides valuable flexibility for working from home, creative pursuits or an additional private retreat.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, established gardens, a generous flat lawn and a north-west-facing rear garden create an appealing setting for entertaining, children and long summer afternoons. A single garage and additional off street parking complete the practical appeal.\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle is every bit as compelling. Cheltenham Beach, local cafes and neighbourhood shops are close by, while Devonport Village, its boutiques, restaurants and convenient ferry connection to Auckland's CBD are within easy reach. Coastal walks, waterfront reserves and sought-after schooling further enhance an address where seaside living and city convenience come together effortlessly.\r\n\r\nImagine morning walks along the waterfront, coffee at your favourite local, evenings gathered around the fire and weekends entertaining in the garden. This is the appeal of Devonport living, with the added advantage of a beautifully renovated home where there is nothing left to do.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a professional couple seeking a coastal change, a family wanting a quality home with outdoor space, or downsizers looking for character, comfort and convenience, this home deserves your immediate attention. The combination of a completed renovation, substantial freehold land, versatile accommodation and proximity to the coast makes this a particularly compelling proposition.\r\n\r\nOur VIDEO TOUR showcases the inviting interiors, considered renovation and seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living. However, the true appeal is best appreciated in person. We encourage you to arrange your inspection promptly and experience the property for yourself.\r\n\r\nOur clients are committed to selling. This property will be sold under the hammer.\r\n\r\nThis is not an opportunity to simply watch from the sidelines and wait for another day. If Devonport has been on your radar, or you have been waiting for a renovated coastal home that offers the complete package, now is the time to make your move.\r\n\r\nThe home is ready. Our clients are ready. The auction will deliver the result. Will you be the one taking the keys home?\r\n\r\n12 Sinclair Street. A considered transformation. A coveted coastal setting. An opportunity to secure your place in Devonport.\r\n\r\nProudly marketed by The EK Group, delivering prestige, passion, and property without parallel.",
